    steps: ["Spoon {g:150} Greek yogurt into a bowl, slice {n:1|banana|bananas} over it in 1 cm rounds and drizzle with {tsp:1} honey.", "Eat it 60 to 90 minutes before training: fast carbs, easy on the stomach."],
